187	// shares every gating, binding and evaluation rule with CheckInput; the only
188	// differences are how the witness is supplied (a strict JSON document that
189	// must explicitly contain both string arrays, even when empty) and that an
190	// unreadable or malformed file is reported as an input format error.
191	//
